0822CAA0 sun-clock-snapshot-return

The base minute call leaves the minute in r0. Later reads and writes use r1 through r6.

The explicit form changed the ROM bytes. The guarded form passed the unit ROM check.

--- a/src/system/solar/sub_0822CAA0.c
+++ b/src/system/solar/sub_0822CAA0.c
@@ -21,3 +21,6 @@
         flag = 1;
     *(u32 *)(gGameState + 0x4ec) = flag;
+#ifdef UBFIX
+    return minute; // preserve the inherited GBA return value
+#endif
 }
